flowchart TB
    U[User uploads Pluto drone image] --> UI[Gradio interface]
    UI --> QA[Image quality assessment]
    QA -->|Acceptable| PP[Image preprocessing]
    QA -->|Unacceptable| UV[UNABLE TO VERIFY]
    PP --> REF[Reference annotations P1-P4]
    REF --> VIS[Annotated image visualization]
    VIS --> UV
    VIS -. Future integration .-> DET[Automatic motor / propeller detection]
    DET -. Future integration .-> CLS[Propeller type and orientation analysis]
    CFG[(Verified Pluto reference configuration)] -. Future integration .-> VER[Configuration comparison]
    CLS -. Future integration .-> VER
    VER --> DEC{Reliable comparison?}
    DEC -->|Match| PASS[PASS]
    DEC -->|Mismatch| INC[INCORRECT INSTALLATION]
    DEC -->|Ambiguous| UV
